{"id":"3639c3f839b6c954","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-zfc-topo8-compact-hausdorff-space.md","title":"ZFC Topo8 Compact Hausdorff Space","display":"df-zfc-topo8-compact-hausdorff-space — ZFC Topo8 Compact Hausdorff Space","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-topo8-compact-hausdorff-space","aliases":["58-df-zfc-topo8-compact-hausdorff-space"],"display":"df-zfc-topo8-compact-hausdorff-space — ZFC Topo8 Compact Hausdorff Space","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-top5-compact-space]]","[[58-df-zfc-top5-hausdorff-space]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-topo8-compact-hausdorff-space"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-topo8-compact-hausdorff-space</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-topo8-compact-hausdorff-space — ZFC Topo8 Compact Hausdorff Space"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"06b5f03f1e28a63b\" href=\"?note=06b5f03f1e28a63b\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top5-compact-space\">58-df-zfc-top5-compact-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"69f8a4b0afb36176\" href=\"?note=69f8a4b0afb36176\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top5-hausdorff-space\">58-df-zfc-top5-hausdorff-space</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (ambient formal setting)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5CompactSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5CompactSpace}_S\\)</span> (compact-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"06b5f03f1e28a63b\" href=\"?note=06b5f03f1e28a63b\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top5-compact-space\">58-df-zfc-top5-compact-space</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5HausdorffSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5HausdorffSpace}_S\\)</span> (Hausdorff-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"69f8a4b0afb36176\" href=\"?note=69f8a4b0afb36176\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top5-hausdorff-space\">58-df-zfc-top5-hausdorff-space</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo8CompactHausdorffSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo8CompactHausdorffSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo8\\text{-}compact\\text{-}hausdorff\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopo8CompactHausdorffSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop5CompactSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land \\mathrm{ZfcTop5HausdorffSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo8\\text{-}compact\\text{-}hausdorff\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopo8CompactHausdorffSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop5CompactSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land \\mathrm{ZfcTop5HausdorffSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Compactness and Hausdorff separation are required of the same topology <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","st